{"file_name": "IMG_E0932 (1).png", "id": "1614854872672027", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569432_1614854876005360_1625138280097468139_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s9_Iwzx4QJAQ7kNvwHeWQSZ&_nc_oc=Adqh8KPHpAuw6qpRio_Ru671f31MAzVmQMggcDA42G2ZLfjhXN5O1AlVYQffHdnfz_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT2j6IfO583WKri_yeMtG9EYBWKwMm5UJefMYKPIuMi0g&oe=6B0DB263"}, "display_name": "Vacation Monkeys", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Escape reality,  and relax on the beautiful oasis known as vacation island! Vacation monkeys is a multiplayer game where monkeys can chill at the beach, enjoy many physical activities such as parkour, basketball,  try and reach the end of the glass bridge and don't step on the wrong piece of glass or it might just crack! There's even a PVP fighting mode where you can face your friends in a duel with lightsabers! Don't forget to customize your monkey in the shop with many fun cosmetics, and even search the map for secret collectable cosmetics that you can show off to your monkey friends! And Much more! Get the game now, and enjoy the world of Vacation Island!", "short_description": "Relax on the beautiful oasis known as vacation island! Vacation monkeys is a multiplayer game where monkeys can chill at the beach, enjoy many physical activities such as parkour, basketball,  try and reach the end of the glass bridge and don't step on the wrong piece of glass or it might just crack! There's even a PVP fighting mode where you can face your friends in a duel with lightsabers! And Much more! Get the game now, and enjoy the world of Vacation Island!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTCwcvq_jRwg5OKxuIjM36cqVWZ-lAaO5sNRM-EoKCFToCQG8yfvezRC8aid58_GgaKHrlbkH5PHeJB/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Joe-rilla", "support_website_url": null, "website